er payment ran on 26 September 2026 and sent GME stock tokens straight to holder wallets, including wallets with no connection to the project. Nothing was claimed and nothing was staked. Transaction 0xb0d23da70772ff6db5e432c8474e52c12641b0297da8018f37e13d8f536d8fa7.\n\nEvery trade carries a 5% fee, split on chain by a fee splitter contract rather than by anyone's discretion:\n\n60% buys GME and sends it straight to the wallets of everyone holding RESTRICTED at the time of payment. No claim button, no staking contract, no lockup, no minimum hold time.\n15% buys GME that the token contract itself holds as backing. Any holder can burn their RESTRICTED to redeem a proportional share of it.\n15% buys RESTRICTED on the open market and burns it.\n5% to pool liquidity, 5% to the creator.\n\nThe distribution engine retains 7.5% of what it routes, which pays the on-chain cost of sending the payments.\n\nRESTRICTED opened on the Bucket Shop launchpad on 25 September 2026 and graduated the same day into a public Uniswap V4 pool paired against USDG. Distribution ran through a public bonding curve open to anyone from the first block, with no presale and no private round. A 99% tax applied to buys in the first three seconds and then expired, which stops automated snipers accumulating supply before ordinary buyers can transact. The launchpad takes a permanent 0% fee from this token as its founding launch.\n\nHolder concentration, stated plainly: total supply is 918,367,347 XGME and the creator wallet holds 388,105,700 of it, about 42 percent. Anyone can verify that on chain.\n\nEvery contract behind the token is source verified on the Robinhood Chain Blockscout explorer: the token, the bonding curve, the fee splitter and the liquidity lock.\n\nBuilt by Bucket Labs LLC, which also operates Bucket Shop.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://sellonly.wtf"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/vyc4t4c7rfxfzug3gupkeg2qo54t3sgtrmkvcxk1wih","chainId":"solana","tokenA